    <code code="10160-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Medication use Narrative"/>
    <title>Medications</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>Medication</th><th>Frequency</th><th>Route</th><th>Dates</th><th>Status</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr ID="medication-1"><td>Opium-containing compounded herbal paste (an electuary of honey, many herbs and poppy, from an overseas supplier; not prescribed and not regulated, so its morphine content is unknown), about a pea-sized amount (roughly 0.5 g) by mouth at bedtime most nights for about six years, and now and then in the morning before a long day</td><td>About 0.5 g at bedtime most nights; occasionally a second amount in the morning</td><td>Oral route</td><td>2020-05-01 to 2026-06-06</td><td>completed</td><td>S</td></tr><tr ID="medication-2"><td>Calcium carbonate 500 mg chewable tablet, one or two tablets as needed for heartburn, no more than six a day, until the endoscopy</td><td>One or two tablets as needed, at least four hours apart; no more than six a day</td><td>Oral route</td><td>2026-05-12 to 2026-05-19</td><td>completed</td><td>S</td></tr><tr ID="medication-3"><td>Polyethylene glycol 3350 powder, 17 g dissolved in a glass of water by mouth once daily as needed for constipation</td><td>17 g once daily as needed</td><td>Oral route</td><td>2026-05-12</td><td>active</td><td>S</td></tr><tr ID="medication-4"><td>Naloxone 4 mg nasal spray, one spray into one nostril for suspected opioid overdose, repeated in 2 to 3 minutes in the other nostril if there is no response; call 911</td><td>One spray for suspected overdose; repeat every 2 to 3 minutes if needed</td><td>Nasal route</td><td>2026-05-12</td><td>active</td><td>S</td></tr><tr ID="medication-5"><td>Omeprazole 20 mg delayed-release capsule, one capsule by mouth 30 to 60 minutes before breakfast for eight weeks, for erosive esophagitis</td><td>One capsule each morning before breakfast for eight weeks</td><td>Oral route</td><td>2026-05-19 to 2026-07-14</td><td>completed</td><td>S</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

